{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>עד אחד (not even one).</b> Even one, as I will explain in the Song [of the Sea]. The sense of this verse: even though he sent and saw that HaShem loves Israel, and for their sake struck his livestock, he did not take heed concerning the livestock in this plague to send with him — perhaps it did not amount to much:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:52.320848854Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}